  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's been awhile since I've logged into VRChat but I had this idea awhile back. Basically it's an event where an evil entity invades VRChat. This evil entity summons minions that come through portals to attack VRChatters. It won't matter what world you're in. You could be attacked at any time. VRChatters could be given a special weapon that hurts the evil minions.\n\nHowever, some worlds could be deemed safe for people who just want to talk and hang out, while others could be at risk of being invaded by these evil minions. Some worlds can be lost if no one stops them. Perhaps a menu could be implemented that tells VRChatters which worlds are currently being invaded. It's up to the VRChatters to stop this menace. Enemies could drop certain items that can be turned in for rewards. \n\nHopefully this idea doesn't sound dumb. ^^;",
